# Agency Upgrade Compatibility

Status: DONE
Milestone: Restore configured Ask and tolerate contract-compatible Agency updates
Dependencies: 39_INSTALLED_CLI_ANSWERS.todo, 42_DIRECT_FAST_ANSWERS.todo

## Purpose

Diagnose the disabled Ask provider button without bypassing provider readiness or silently
accepting incompatible providers. Version changes alone should not block readiness; validate the
runtime protocol, required capabilities and strict safety configuration before any question.

## Tasks

- [x] Trace Ask eligibility and inspect content-free startup diagnostics.
- [x] Confirm installed wrapper version independently without prompting.
- [x] Replace fixed wrapper/engine pins with version identity and runtime capability checks.
- [x] Verify empty-session preparation and an explicitly authorized synthetic answer.
- [x] Exercise older/current/future-compatible identities and breaking protocol/tool/configuration peers.
- [x] Update affected guides, source annotations, handbook/atlas, index and development journal.

## Acceptance criteria

- [x] The installed build can reach readiness and complete a synthetic answer through the real adapter.
- [x] Malformed identities, incompatible ACP and unsafe tool/configuration states remain rejected.
- [x] No automatic question, provider fallback, new login, account change or live audio capture.
- [x] Existing user edits and immutable Preview 1/2 assets remain unchanged.
- [x] Evidence distinguishes local source correction from published binaries and live-meeting qualification.

